{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"cat > /tmp/journal_entry <<'EOF'\n# Research Journal\n\n## Iteration 1 — Starter baseline and volatility diagnosis\n\n- **Hypothesis:** The starter model's standard deviation of every adjacent observed minute return, scaled by square-root time, is miscalibrated because gaps create multi-minute returns treated as one minute and seven-day equal weighting reacts poorly to regime changes. This should hurt both 24h and 1h CRPS, especially on volatile crypto.\n- **Change:** None yet; establish official-backtester baselines at 1000 paths on two post-split regimes, then inspect standardized realized moves. Primary quick windows: 2026-07-10 to 2026-07-12 and 2026-08-27 to 2026-08-29. Kill threshold for replacing the baseline: candidate must improve mean CRPS on both BTC formats in at least one window and not worsen either competition-level proxy by more than 3% across the second window.\n- **Result:** Pending.\n- **Verdict:** Pending.\n- **Lesson:** Pending.\nEOF\napply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: agent/journal.md\n@@\n+# Research Journal\n+\n+## Iteration 1 — Starter baseline and volatility diagnosis\n+\n+- **Hypothesis:** The starter model's standard deviation of every adjacent observed minute return, scaled by square-root time, is miscalibrated because gaps create multi-minute returns treated as one minute and seven-day equal weighting reacts poorly to regime changes. This should hurt both 24h and 1h CRPS, especially on volatile crypto.\n+- **Change:** None yet; establish official-backtester baselines at 1000 paths on two post-split regimes, then inspect standardized realized moves. Primary quick windows: 2026-07-10 to 2026-07-12 and 2026-08-27 to 2026-08-29. Kill threshold for replacing the baseline: candidate must improve mean CRPS on both BTC formats in at least one window and not worsen either competition-level proxy by more than 3% across the second window.\n+- **Result:** Pending.\n+- **Verdict:** Pending.\n+- **Lesson:** Pending.\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\nprintf '%s\\\\n' '--- BUDGET ---'; cat agent/BUDGET.md\nprintf '%s\\\\n' '--- BACKTEST SIGNATURES ---'; nl -ba .venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth_lib/backtester/orchestration.py | sed -n '40,120p'; nl -ba .venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth_lib/backtester/orchestration.py | sed -n '450,525p'\nprintf '%s\\\\n' '--- ASSET COEFFICIENTS ---'; sed -n '17,42p' .venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/moving_average.py\nprintf '%s\\\\n' '--- SMOOTHED FORMULA ---'; sed -n '109,210p' .venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/moving_average.py\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
